// "Continue with Google" on iPhone opens Google's sign-in page, which
// returns to the app through this URL scheme: the iOS OAuth client id
// (Google Cloud > APIs & Services > Credentials > the iOS client for
// com.mldynamic.fieldos), reversed. It is public (it ships inside every
// copy of the app), so it is fine in git.
//
// The build passes the same client, forwards, as
// --dart-define=GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=...; without it the Google button is
// hidden on iPhone and this placeholder does nothing.
GOOGLE_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID = com.mldynamic.fieldos.google-not-set
